From: Gustavo Almeida Barrios <gabarrios2006@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:15:41 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Raw info queries, MEX queries and every app state mutation

- SendIQ / SendMexIQ (goneonize/rawiq.go, JSON in and out) and the
  client's send_iq / send_mex, for what whatsmeow has no function for;
- AppStateMutation (57): every app state mutation with its collection,
  version and operation, also during a full sync;
- MutationInfo.Remove: send_app_state can send a REMOVE.
